<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA BEAT WESTERN PROVINCE BY 32 RUNS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA BEAT WESTERN PROVINCE BY 32 RUNS.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia beat Western Province</p>
<p>by 32 runs on the final day of their three-day match at Newlands</p>
<p>on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 439-4 declared and 175-6 declared.</p>
<p>Western Province 261-5 declared and 321 all out.</p>
</text>
